      "text": "2 / 链上快照（规划）\n读取当前余额和源/目标 risk epochs\n读取 routeEpoch / signerEpoch\n固定 factory、walletKey、destination\namount = expectedBalance = 全余额",
      "originalText": "2 / 链上快照（规划）\n读取当前余额和源/目标 risk epochs\n读取 routeEpoch / signerEpoch\n固定 factory、walletKey、destination\namount = expectedBalance = 全余额",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
