      "text": "3 / 受限 RiskAuthorizer（规划）\n先落 PERMIT_POSSIBLE 再请求签名\n绑定 operationId、风险证据摘要\nhashSweep 比对 EIP-712 digest\n持久 ACK 后允许执行器取用",
      "originalText": "3 / 受限 RiskAuthorizer（规划）\n先落 PERMIT_POSSIBLE 再请求签名\n绑定 operationId、风险证据摘要\nhashSweep 比对 EIP-712 digest\n持久 ACK 后允许执行器取用",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-permit",
