      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 / Relayer 批次（规划）\nbatchDeployAndSweep(...)\n最多 50 项；operationId 不可重复\n每项 gas 100k—2M；签名 ≤4096 B\n总 calldata ≤131072 B；预留外层 Gas",
      "originalText": "4 / Relayer 批次（规划）\nbatchDeployAndSweep(...)\n最多 50 项；operationId 不可重复\n每项 gas 100k—2M；签名 ≤4096 B\n总 calldata ≤131072 B；预留外层 Gas",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-batch",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
