      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "失败项 / RETRYABLE 或 UNCERTAIN\nItemFailed：该子调用全部回滚\n部署/转账/消费标记都回滚\n原 Permit 仍可能继续执行\n暂停/不再需要时撤销该 ID",
      "originalText": "失败项 / RETRYABLE 或 UNCERTAIN\nItemFailed：该子调用全部回滚\n部署/转账/消费标记都回滚\n原 Permit 仍可能继续执行\n暂停/不再需要时撤销该 ID",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-failed",
      "autoResize": false,
