      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "失败重试：单项失败或外层 revert 不等于业务终结。\noperationId 撤销使用 Manager.cancelOperation，由 Guardian/Council/Timelock 受控调用。\n风险 HOLD/解除提升 epoch，旧授权不会在恢复后重新有效。\n外层 success 也不表示每一项成功。",
      "originalText": "失败重试：单项失败或外层 revert 不等于业务终结。\noperationId 撤销使用 Manager.cancelOperation，由 Guardian/Council/Timelock 受控调用。\n风险 HOLD/解除提升 epoch，旧授权不会在恢复后重新有效。\n外层 success 也不表示每一项成功。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-note1",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
